WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.032 --> 00:00:08.397
Ben floated through the halls of Monster Academy on Thursday afternoon.

2
00:00:08.417 --> 00:00:18.084
Near the auditorium cheerleaders were selling orange T-shirts and black T-shirts.

3
00:00:30.828 --> 00:00:32.228
"Get your Team Orange shirts!"

4
00:00:32.809 --> 00:00:33.429
one shouted.

5
00:00:33.449 --> 00:00:36.430
"Team Black shirts here!"

6
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:37.630
another called.

7
00:00:38.690 --> 00:00:39.470
Ben grinned.

8
00:00:40.231 --> 00:00:44.372
Tomorrow was Field Day, and everyone seemed super excited.

9
00:00:47.113 --> 00:00:50.754
He'd heard from Winnie and Mog that the day was tons of fun.

10
00:00:51.714 --> 00:00:58.176
Two teams competed against each other in games like tug-of-war and sack races while the rest of the

11
00:00:58.236 --> 00:00:59.336
school cheered them on.

12
00:01:00.572 --> 00:01:05.353
Only 12 monsters competed, and Ben was hoping he'd get to be one of them.

13
00:01:05.373 --> 00:01:10.795
"I really want to be on Team Orange," a worm monster said.

14
00:01:10.815 --> 00:01:16.257
"Sorry, Francis, but you don't stand a chance," a werewolf replied.

15
00:01:16.277 --> 00:01:17.997
"You have to be fast."

16
00:01:18.017 --> 00:01:21.418
"Oh." Francis hung his head.

17
00:01:21.438 --> 00:01:23.979
"Is there a digging event?"

18
00:01:25.039 --> 00:01:27.020
A loudspeaker crackled loudly.

19
00:01:27.832 --> 00:01:31.133
"All students to the auditorium for the pep rally!"

20
00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:34.195
Mr. Freaky, the school principal, announced.

21
00:01:35.635 --> 00:01:37.216
Pixel floated up to Ben.

22
00:01:37.236 --> 00:01:38.657
"Hey, Ben.

23
00:01:39.037 --> 00:01:41.118
Can I sit with you for the pep rally?"

24
00:01:41.138 --> 00:01:43.759
"Sure," Ben replied.

25
00:01:43.779 --> 00:01:45.119
"Have you seen Winnie?"

26
00:01:46.080 --> 00:01:47.280
Pixel shook his head.

27
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.101
"Nope." "Huh."

28
00:01:51.462 --> 00:01:56.224
Ben had been hoping to sit with Winnie at the pep rally, but he didn't see her anywhere.

29
00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:00.602
The students settled into their seats.

30
00:02:02.043 --> 00:02:07.788
Some were already wearing orange or black T-shirts, even though the Field Day teams hadn't been chosen yet.

31
00:02:12.072 --> 00:02:16.196
For a few minutes, Miss Bungle and the cheerleaders led some cheers.

32
00:02:52.712 --> 00:02:53.292
Then Mr.

33
00:02:53.352 --> 00:02:56.734
Freaky hurried onto the stage, his noses wiggling.

34
00:02:56.754 --> 00:02:59.236
"Good afternoon, students.

35
00:03:01.117 --> 00:03:04.239
I know you're excited to hear about the teams for Field Day.

36
00:03:05.319 --> 00:03:05.940
So Mr.

37
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.221
Gwarg will choose the captains and explain a few rules."

38
00:03:12.723 --> 00:03:15.005
The gym teacher stepped up to the microphone.

39
00:03:15.025 --> 00:03:19.487
"Okay, monsters," Mr.

40
00:03:19.527 --> 00:03:20.288
Gwarg began.

41
00:03:20.844 --> 00:03:24.987
"There will be two teams this year, orange and black."

42
00:03:26.268 --> 00:03:28.650
"We had orange and black last year!"

43
00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:30.251
a fish monster yelled.

44
00:03:31.012 --> 00:03:33.734
An orange monster with black spots stood up.

45
00:03:34.695 --> 00:03:36.656
"What's wrong with orange and black?"

46
00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:38.778
Everyone laughed.

47
00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.721
The fish monster grinned sheepishly.

48
00:03:44.702 --> 00:03:46.744
Mr. Gwarg ignored the laughter.

49
00:03:47.608 --> 00:03:51.909
"I've chosen two captains based on their performance in gym class.

50
00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:57.691
The captain of Team Orange is Zork."

51
00:03:57.711 --> 00:04:02.352
"Yes!" A lizard monster leaped to his feet and pumped a fist.

52
00:04:02.752 --> 00:04:04.813
Other monsters started hooting and cheering.

53
00:04:08.914 --> 00:04:10.895
choice!" Pixel said to Ben.

54
00:04:10.915 --> 00:04:13.795
"Zork is a fantastic athlete.

55
00:04:14.196 --> 00:04:15.476
He'll be a great captain."

56
00:04:16.584 --> 00:04:18.045
"I guess," Ben muttered.

57
00:04:18.065 --> 00:04:21.227
"I mean, if you don't mind your captain showing off all the time."

58
00:04:22.168 --> 00:04:25.690
Lots of monsters liked Zork, but Ben wasn't one of them.

59
00:04:26.211 --> 00:04:31.554
He'd been a little jealous of Zork ever since the Monster Mash dance, when Zork had danced with

60
00:04:31.634 --> 00:04:33.015
Winnie all night long.

61
00:04:35.357 --> 00:04:37.138
Mr. Gwarg cleared his throat.

62
00:04:37.158 --> 00:04:43.762
"The captain of Team Black is Mog."

63
00:04:43.782 --> 00:04:50.619
"Woo-hoo!" Mog got up and did a little celebration dance.

64
00:04:50.659 --> 00:04:52.220
Ben cheered for his friend.

65
00:04:52.240 --> 00:04:54.082
"This is so great!"

66
00:04:54.482 --> 00:04:55.002
he thought.

67
00:04:56.063 --> 00:04:58.425
Mog would definitely pick Ben for his team.

68
00:04:59.385 --> 00:05:01.447
Mog would definitely ask Winnie too.

69
00:05:01.467 --> 00:05:09.012
"As you know, each team captain may now pick five students for his team," Mr.

70
00:05:09.052 --> 00:05:09.773
Gwarg said.

71
00:05:09.793 --> 00:05:14.216
"Remember, there's no magic during Field Day activities.

72
00:05:16.312 --> 00:05:20.095
And don't forget to bring your best school spirit!"

73
00:05:21.196 --> 00:05:27.041
A few minutes later, the pep rally ended, and everyone began filing out of the auditorium.

74
00:05:28.142 --> 00:05:30.164
Mog rushed over to Ben and Pixel.

75
00:05:30.784 --> 00:05:31.645
"Hey, you guys.

76
00:05:32.065 --> 00:05:33.767
Want to be on Team Black?"

77
00:05:33.787 --> 00:05:35.748
"You bet!"

78
00:05:36.128 --> 00:05:36.889
Pixel said.

79
00:05:36.909 --> 00:05:38.530
"Sounds awesome!"

80
00:05:38.831 --> 00:05:40.732
Ben said, giving Mog a high five.

81
00:05:40.752 --> 00:05:42.454
"Who else is on the team?"

82
00:05:42.474 --> 00:05:46.076
"Deb and Waldo," he replied.

83
00:05:46.096 --> 00:05:49.038
"Waldo?" Ben blurted out.

84
00:05:49.879 --> 00:05:50.979
Then he felt bad.

85
00:05:51.559 --> 00:05:54.961
Waldo was a good friend, but he wasn't very athletic.

86
00:06:01.685 --> 00:06:02.485
Mog shrugged.

87
00:06:02.505 --> 00:06:06.868
"I know he's not very fast, but he's good at catching.

88
00:06:07.268 --> 00:06:09.509
We might need that in the slime ball toss.

89
00:06:11.951 --> 00:06:14.432
I have to find one more monster for the team though."

90
00:06:15.064 --> 00:06:15.704
"What about Winnie?"

91
00:06:16.084 --> 00:06:17.025
Ben said quickly.

92
00:06:17.045 --> 00:06:21.167
"I already asked her, but she said no," Mog said.

93
00:06:21.187 --> 00:06:24.148
"Really?" Ben was shocked.

94
00:06:25.148 --> 00:06:26.009
Mog shrugged.

95
00:06:26.029 --> 00:06:28.550
"I don't get it either.

96
00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.831
She was acting kind of weird."

97
00:06:31.931 --> 00:06:32.591
"Where is she?"

98
00:06:32.992 --> 00:06:34.592
Ben asked, looking around.

99
00:06:34.612 --> 00:06:37.113
"Maybe I can convince her to change her mind."

100
00:06:38.374 --> 00:06:39.114
"She's out there."

101
00:06:39.714 --> 00:06:41.375
Mog waved toward the hallway.

102
00:06:41.395 --> 00:06:42.976
"Give it a try, Ben.

103
00:06:44.148 --> 00:06:45.929
It would be great to have her on our team.

104
00:06:46.409 --> 00:06:50.130
I'm going to hold the first Team Black practice in the gym in a little while."

105
00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:52.470
"Okay. I'll let you know what she says."

106
00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:57.492
Ben zipped outside, scanning the crowded hallway for Winnie.

107
00:06:58.152 --> 00:07:00.032
He knew he could get her to join the team.

108
00:07:00.833 --> 00:07:03.913
Finally he spotted her at the opposite end of the hallway.

109
00:07:04.954 --> 00:07:07.554
But as Ben got closer, his heart sank.

110
00:07:08.375 --> 00:07:12.656
Winnie was talking and laughing with the captain of Team
